Package: noggalito-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: OpenPGP key and APT source of the noggalito package repository
 The public key that signs the APT repository of noggalito
 (https://noggalito.com/apps/deb/), where berigna and the other
 applications of noggalito are published, and the deb822 source that
 points apt to it with that key alone (Signed-By).
 .
 Installing this package keeps the key up to date: a renewed or rotated
 key arrives as an update of this package before the old one expires.
